rebuttal.value:
We thank the reviewers for taking the time to read our paper and for providing insightful feedback and input.

In each rebuttal we addressed the individual concerns of the reviewers and we are happy to respond to any additional doubts or questions.
In the PDF uploaded in this "general" response, we provide the following additional results and clarifying figures, following reviewers' suggestions:
- Additional experiments on CIFAR100 and Tiny-Imagenet;
- Additional OOD experiments, with new OOD detectors and more  CIFAR-C corruptions;
- Preliminary ImageNet results;
- A toy example of AUCOC improvement.

